(5751832, 835916, 49865, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with this, and the toothbrush bristles from this angle are a great subject. the background is way distracting and busy though, and I feel like the orange may not be a good complement for the red white and blue. you should try photographing this guy again on a low saturation, featureless or solid color background, i think it would look really neat.</td>', 'I like the idea with this, and the toothbrush bristles from this angle are a great subject. the background is way distracting and busy though, and I feel like the orange may not be a good complement for the red white and blue. you should try photographing this guy again on a low saturation, featureless or solid color background, i think it would look really neat.', '2009-12-03 04:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
