(5753005, 837102, 83686, '<td valign="top">Looks to be shot through glass. Any time I shoot through glass I try to use a cup between the lens and the glass to prevent any glare. Anyway, good subject but the colors are very faded looking.</td>', 'Looks to be shot through glass. Any time I shoot through glass I try to use a cup between the lens and the glass to prevent any glare. Anyway, good subject but the colors are very faded looking.', '2009-12-03 20:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753006, 836699, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good macro. Depth of field is good as well.</td>', 'Good macro. Depth of field is good as well.', '2009-12-03 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753007, 835874, 83686, '<td valign="top">Over processed IMO</td>', 'Over processed IMO', '2009-12-03 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753010, 837028, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good macro. Color, framing and lighting are done well.</td>', 'Good macro. Color, framing and lighting are done well.', '2009-12-03 20:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753011, 836186, 83686, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems to be an issue here but otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Lighting seems to be an issue here but otherwise a good shot.', '2009-12-03 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753012, 837102, 111808, '<td valign="top">The co-mingling colours in this are very beautiful, almost iridescent. I have often thought that these anemones open up like living flowers but you have captured this concept perfectly and it also illustrates their cohesiveness and cooperation. The water magnification makes them resemble a delicate sea bouquet. Excellent photograph.</td>', 'The co-mingling colours in this are very beautiful, almost iridescent. I have often thought that these anemones open up like living flowers but you have captured this concept perfectly and it also illustrates their cohesiveness and cooperation. The water magnification makes them resemble a delicate sea bouquet. Excellent photograph.', '2009-12-03 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753013, 837133, 83686, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like the clarity, lighting and framing.</td>', 'Very well done. I like the clarity, lighting and framing.', '2009-12-03 20:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753016, 836346, 83686, '<td valign="top">Ice is a hard subject to macro. No definition except for the air bubbles and just too busy.</td>', 'Ice is a hard subject to macro. No definition except for the air bubbles and just too busy.', '2009-12-03 20:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753019, 837145, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field.</td>', 'Good use of depth of field.', '2009-12-03 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753021, 835741, 83686, '<td valign="top">To shallow of DOF. No clarity in the drops and possibly OOF</td>', 'To shallow of DOF. No clarity in the drops and possibly OOF', '2009-12-03 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753023, 837131, 83686, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF on this macro. Clarity of the subject is excellent. Only angling the nail or needle in the shot would have made it better.</td>', 'Nice DOF on this macro. Clarity of the subject is excellent. Only angling the nail or needle in the shot would have made it better.', '2009-12-03 20:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753024, 835970, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good macro but the dark background points out all the stray pieces in the feathers</td>', 'Good macro but the dark background points out all the stray pieces in the feathers', '2009-12-03 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753025, 835900, 111808, '<td valign="top">Sleep Number 8 - Delightful, as I have never really taken the time to study bedsprings before. The patterns and colour tones of the ties complement this and are reinforced by the diagonal repetitions of the exposed bedframe. I do wonder about what the sole black thread in the front centre is tied to however, but that is more a curious musing on my part. Sharp &amp; creative capture.</td>', 'Sleep Number 8 - Delightful, as I have never really taken the time to study bedsprings before. The patterns and colour tones of the ties complement this and are reinforced by the diagonal repetitions of the exposed bedframe. I do wonder about what the sole black thread in the front centre is tied to however, but that is more a curious musing on my part. Sharp & creative capture.', '2009-12-03 20:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753026, 836260, 83686, '<td valign="top">I like this and I think it is pretty original. The only issue I see is the spots on the water.</td>', 'I like this and I think it is pretty original. The only issue I see is the spots on the water.', '2009-12-03 20:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753030, 837014, 83686, '<td valign="top">Focus seems off and there is quite a bit of noise in the shot. Perhaps using a high aperture setting would have cleaned that up</td>', 'Focus seems off and there is quite a bit of noise in the shot. Perhaps using a high aperture setting would have cleaned that up', '2009-12-03 20:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753031, 836176, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think this would do better as a landscape crop....shaving a bit off the top of the photo.</td>', 'I think this would do better as a landscape crop....shaving a bit off the top of the photo.', '2009-12-03 20:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753032, 836585, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting. I don''t like all the lines in these shoes and would have chose a tighter crop. But overall very good.</td>', 'Good focus and lighting. I don''t like all the lines in these shoes and would have chose a tighter crop. But overall very good.', '2009-12-03 20:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753033, 836489, 83686, '<td valign="top">HArd to stay focused on anything in this shot</td>', 'HArd to stay focused on anything in this shot', '2009-12-03 20:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753034, 836617, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good macro, seems a bit too light to me. Maybe a higher contrast would have pleased me but overall everything else looks good.</td>', 'Good macro, seems a bit too light to me. Maybe a higher contrast would have pleased me but overall everything else looks good.', '2009-12-03 20:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753038, 836004, 90495, '<td valign="top">No idea how big or small this is. This could be either 6ft or 1/4 inch long.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful image that was very well captured.</td>', 'No idea how big or small this is. This could be either 6ft or 1/4 inch long. It''s a beautiful image that was very well captured.', '2009-12-03 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753039, 836176, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the eye but I don''t like the blown out lighting effect on the right</td>', 'Good focus on the eye but I don''t like the blown out lighting effect on the right', '2009-12-03 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753043, 836557, 90495, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell how small this is. It actually looks huge.</td>', 'Can''t tell how small this is. It actually looks huge.', '2009-12-03 20:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753044, 835973, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good subject and concept. Would have like to see a different lighting set up because this seems a bit harsh</td>', 'Good subject and concept. Would have like to see a different lighting set up because this seems a bit harsh', '2009-12-03 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753048, 837105, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me the background on this is flat and dull...you have the start of bokeh on the upper middle part...more of that and it would have added interest</td>', 'for me the background on this is flat and dull...you have the start of bokeh on the upper middle part...more of that and it would have added interest', '2009-12-03 20:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753049, 835839, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is definitely macro...but the subject you choose isn''t very engaging...sorry</td>', 'this is definitely macro...but the subject you choose isn''t very engaging...sorry', '2009-12-03 20:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753051, 835936, 108525, '<td valign="top">really needs to be slightly rotated CW</td>', 'really needs to be slightly rotated CW', '2009-12-03 20:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753052, 835916, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me the background is distracting</td>', 'for me the background is distracting', '2009-12-03 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753055, 837005, 90495, '<td valign="top">Technically this is not good. Compositionally this is not good. It is essential that macros be in very precise focus and not just an out of focus blurb such as this. Terrible terrible macro.</td>', 'Technically this is not good. Compositionally this is not good. It is essential that macros be in very precise focus and not just an out of focus blurb such as this. Terrible terrible macro.', '2009-12-03 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753056, 837083, 98339, '<td valign="top">gives me the willies...IMO you had to get much closer to your subject (mind you I''d of found a different subject)...</td>', 'gives me the willies...IMO you had to get much closer to your subject (mind you I''d of found a different subject)...', '2009-12-03 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753058, 837078, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have a great water/milk drop...but it is OOF...</td>', 'you have a great water/milk drop...but it is OOF...', '2009-12-03 20:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753069, 837035, 83686, '<td valign="top">Lighting shows all the dust on the subject. A cleaned board would have been better.</td>', 'Lighting shows all the dust on the subject. A cleaned board would have been better.', '2009-12-03 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753070, 837104, 90495, '<td valign="top">My eyes want the bubbles to the right to be in extreme focus, that''s where they''re lead to by this composition.</td>', 'My eyes want the bubbles to the right to be in extreme focus, that''s where they''re lead to by this composition.', '2009-12-03 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753071, 837048, 111808, '<td valign="top">The textures of the cream coloured cracked and peeling paint contrast nicely with the greenish grey tint of the old wood underneath on this doorway. The eye goes immediately to the dark Simmons lock crisp and highlighted by the layers of paint around it and the repeating circles invite you in - but this has long ago ceased to be accessible. The viewer is left to wonder about this on many levels but does not have the Key that will open it nor reveal the answer. Superb macro.</td>', 'The textures of the cream coloured cracked and peeling paint contrast nicely with the greenish grey tint of the old wood underneath on this doorway. The eye goes immediately to the dark Simmons lock crisp and highlighted by the layers of paint around it and the repeating circles invite you in - but this has long ago ceased to be accessible. The viewer is left to wonder about this on many levels but does not have the Key that will open it nor reveal the answer. Superb macro.', '2009-12-03 21:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753072, 836152, 83686, '<td valign="top">Good concept but not well executed IMO. Good focus and capture but a full burn or first strike would be better.</td>', 'Good concept but not well executed IMO. Good focus and capture but a full burn or first strike would be better.', '2009-12-03 21:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753074, 836999, 83686, '<td valign="top">Lighting needs to be on the subject and the shot seems like it has a lot of noise in it</td>', 'Lighting needs to be on the subject and the shot seems like it has a lot of noise in it', '2009-12-03 21:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753076, 836163, 83686, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to be very close up. Lighting is too harsh as well.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to be very close up. Lighting is too harsh as well.', '2009-12-03 21:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753077, 836849, 98339, '<td valign="top">nice clear shot...well done</td>', 'nice clear shot...well done', '2009-12-03 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753078, 836337, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice. At first it looks like you missed the focus but upon further viewing this really stands out as a unique macro of the eye region. My highest scoring image so far.</td>', 'Nice. At first it looks like you missed the focus but upon further viewing this really stands out as a unique macro of the eye region. My highest scoring image so far.', '2009-12-03 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
