(5753128, 837040, 111808, '<td valign="top">The ghost fingertips lend a whimsical touch to this. All this wonderful computerised technology and still the layout of the keyboard has not changed since 1874 when the first qwerty was designed to slow down the typist!</td>', 'The ghost fingertips lend a whimsical touch to this. All this wonderful computerised technology and still the layout of the keyboard has not changed since 1874 when the first qwerty was designed to slow down the typist!', '2009-12-03 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
