(5753216, 835833, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp eye centre with the iris reflection - the patterns and colours of the cornea are exquisite and the lens capture so intricate that the blood vessels feeding nutriments can be seen. The lash cilia are sharp and you can see the creases in the facial epidermis as well. Superb capture.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp eye centre with the iris reflection - the patterns and colours of the cornea are exquisite and the lens capture so intricate that the blood vessels feeding nutriments can be seen. The lash cilia are sharp and you can see the creases in the facial epidermis as well. Superb capture.', '2009-12-03 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753217, 836187, 88580, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool looking.  The colors and soft focus compliment each-other nicely.  I think it would help to bring up the browns a little and maybe put it on a brown background.<br/> <br/>You do know that the voters don''t like images that are not in focus, right?  lol</td>', 'Pretty cool looking.  The colors and soft focus compliment each-other nicely.  I think it would help to bring up the browns a little and maybe put it on a brown background. You do know that the voters don''t like images that are not in focus, right?  lol', '2009-12-03 21:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753218, 836950, 88580, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and details.  The a-string''s shadow makes the e-string look a little odd--like it has a dark halo.</td>', 'Nice lighting and details.  The a-string''s shadow makes the e-string look a little odd--like it has a dark halo.', '2009-12-03 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753219, 837124, 111808, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph of the horse in which can be seen the patterns of the shaded hairs and coat. The dark eye is crisp and the diagona shape stands out in the composition leading one to study it and perhaps muse about what this intelligent animal may be thinking. The downward comb of the left side mane is echoed by the darker forehead mane which disturbs the horizontal coat lines which adds to the interest.  Black and white simplifies this and concentrates it at the same time. Superb macro.</td>', 'Very nice photograph of the horse in which can be seen the patterns of the shaded hairs and coat. The dark eye is crisp and the diagona shape stands out in the composition leading one to study it and perhaps muse about what this intelligent animal may be thinking. The downward comb of the left side mane is echoed by the darker forehead mane which disturbs the horizontal coat lines which adds to the interest.  Black and white simplifies this and concentrates it at the same time. Superb macro.', '2009-12-03 22:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753228, 836004, 111808, '<td valign="top">The backlight illuminates the delicate edgings of this autumn leaf quite beautifully and brings out the holes and vein patterns. The green background sharpens focus on the subject yet it also reminds that summer was not so long ago really and that changes can come swiftly. I like the central placement which allows the stem stalk to echo and branch out like the original tree.</td>', 'The backlight illuminates the delicate edgings of this autumn leaf quite beautifully and brings out the holes and vein patterns. The green background sharpens focus on the subject yet it also reminds that summer was not so long ago really and that changes can come swiftly. I like the central placement which allows the stem stalk to echo and branch out like the original tree.', '2009-12-03 22:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753236, 836946, 111808, '<td valign="top">He seems such a pleasant fellow with his small but knowing smile. The golden yellow of the flower is subtly reflected in his skin and in the mottled golds he has naturally. Delightful nature macro.</td>', 'He seems such a pleasant fellow with his small but knowing smile. The golden yellow of the flower is subtly reflected in his skin and in the mottled golds he has naturally. Delightful nature macro.', '2009-12-03 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753238, 836622, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in this photograph and a superb reflection in the centre orb.</td>', 'Beautiful colours in this photograph and a superb reflection in the centre orb.', '2009-12-03 22:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753243, 836557, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the repeating shapes and points of this and the orange backlight illumination which warms the shell against the black background. The light dances on the upper right curves and rims and the patterns are liquid and beautiful. Superb capture, a definite favourite.</td>', 'I love the repeating shapes and points of this and the orange backlight illumination which warms the shell against the black background. The light dances on the upper right curves and rims and the patterns are liquid and beautiful. Superb capture, a definite favourite.', '2009-12-03 22:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753248, 836997, 111808, '<td valign="top">The tiny bubble patterns on the red currants enhance this shot and provide circular microcosms of their own. Very nice.</td>', 'The tiny bubble patterns on the red currants enhance this shot and provide circular microcosms of their own. Very nice.', '2009-12-03 22:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753251, 836126, 111808, '<td valign="top">The crisscross pattern enhanced by the rust on the old nail becomes the point of interest as it contrasts so well to the pitted groove diagonals of the equally old wood - even though their colours are closely matched. Textures are warm and visually superb in this shot.</td>', 'The crisscross pattern enhanced by the rust on the old nail becomes the point of interest as it contrasts so well to the pitted groove diagonals of the equally old wood - even though their colours are closely matched. Textures are warm and visually superb in this shot.', '2009-12-03 22:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753253, 836585, 111808, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant and warm coordinating brown colours with the sharp textures of the stitching, cream sole and upper shoe materials. The Tree of Life trademark makes this very harmonious.</td>', 'Very pleasant and warm coordinating brown colours with the sharp textures of the stitching, cream sole and upper shoe materials. The Tree of Life trademark makes this very harmonious.', '2009-12-03 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
