(5753260, 836140, 88580, '<td valign="top">With such a strong geometric pattern, I think the horizontal and vertical lines need to be absolutely horizontal and vertical.  Otherwise, this is a really nice capture.</td>', 'With such a strong geometric pattern, I think the horizontal and vertical lines need to be absolutely horizontal and vertical.  Otherwise, this is a really nice capture.', '2009-12-03 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
