(5753276, 836021, 88580, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  Nice tones.  Cool reflection.  But...a good cleaning would make this a lot better.</td>', 'Great detail.  Nice tones.  Cool reflection.  But...a good cleaning would make this a lot better.', '2009-12-03 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753279, 837036, 88580, '<td valign="top">Just a hair more DOF would be nice, I think...On the other hand the focus really draws the eye to the point.</td>', 'Just a hair more DOF would be nice, I think...On the other hand the focus really draws the eye to the point.', '2009-12-03 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753281, 837057, 88580, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and processing.</td>', 'Nice lighting and processing.', '2009-12-03 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753282, 836870, 111808, '<td valign="top">While it took me a moment to realise what this was, I very much like the textures in it. It is rusted but the colours are warm and it is such an intricate study of a commonplace thing which bears looking at in a new way. Thank you for your expertise in providing that view.</td>', 'While it took me a moment to realise what this was, I very much like the textures in it. It is rusted but the colours are warm and it is such an intricate study of a commonplace thing which bears looking at in a new way. Thank you for your expertise in providing that view.', '2009-12-03 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753283, 836103, 98339, '<td valign="top">Man oh man I want to know what this is and where did you photograph it...this is stunning...beautiful</td>', 'Man oh man I want to know what this is and where did you photograph it...this is stunning...beautiful', '2009-12-03 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753284, 835874, 98339, '<td valign="top">super good job...wonderful focus and detail</td>', 'super good job...wonderful focus and detail', '2009-12-03 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753290, 835874, 111808, '<td valign="top">The repeating folds of this simple mushroom almost resemble an earthen landscape in this superb macro replete with curves and enveloped with complementing warm brownish and grey colour tones. This flows beautifully.</td>', 'The repeating folds of this simple mushroom almost resemble an earthen landscape in this superb macro replete with curves and enveloped with complementing warm brownish and grey colour tones. This flows beautifully.', '2009-12-03 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753294, 836140, 111808, '<td valign="top">The 4 contrasting colours are greatly enhanced by the rough wall textures which highlight the paint strokes. This is simple and abstract, and also quite pleasant to view.</td>', 'The 4 contrasting colours are greatly enhanced by the rough wall textures which highlight the paint strokes. This is simple and abstract, and also quite pleasant to view.', '2009-12-03 23:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753302, 837029, 111808, '<td valign="top">Predominant and repeating circles echoing individual shells large and small make up this also circular sea creature skeleton. The brown tones are warm and engaging but the fractal like patterns draw you in. At the top, in the centre is the black unknown maw.</td>', 'Predominant and repeating circles echoing individual shells large and small make up this also circular sea creature skeleton. The brown tones are warm and engaging but the fractal like patterns draw you in. At the top, in the centre is the black unknown maw.', '2009-12-03 23:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753309, 837087, 111808, '<td valign="top">The frost patterns highlight this tiny delicate noose. How apropros that the cold spider uses it to catch his dinner. How creative and unique that you had the vision to capture it so that others may see as well.</td>', 'The frost patterns highlight this tiny delicate noose. How apropros that the cold spider uses it to catch his dinner. How creative and unique that you had the vision to capture it so that others may see as well.', '2009-12-03 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753320, 837042, 111808, '<td valign="top">Wow - the textures in this are creamy, colourful and delectable. I have eaten many of this fruit in my lifetime but never really paused to look at it in quite the way it is presented here. I see much more now due to this presentation, even in the peel. Well Done.</td>', 'Wow - the textures in this are creamy, colourful and delectable. I have eaten many of this fruit in my lifetime but never really paused to look at it in quite the way it is presented here. I see much more now due to this presentation, even in the peel. Well Done.', '2009-12-03 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753328, 837007, 111808, '<td valign="top">"Soul clap its hand and sing, and Louder sing..." for this superb macro of an aged hand complete with lines and wrinkles, whorls and creases, skin patterns, textures, shapes and the marvel of humanity. Thanks also for the nod to Yeats, a superb Sligo Irish poet.</td>', '"Soul clap its hand and sing, and Louder sing..." for this superb macro of an aged hand complete with lines and wrinkles, whorls and creases, skin patterns, textures, shapes and the marvel of humanity. Thanks also for the nod to Yeats, a superb Sligo Irish poet.', '2009-12-03 23:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753333, 836617, 111808, '<td valign="top">Superb capture of a mushroom, so crisp that each delicate gill folds over onto itself in the cap umbrella making a beautifully fragile pattern of undulating lines and anchored by the stem.  One of my absolute favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Superb capture of a mushroom, so crisp that each delicate gill folds over onto itself in the cap umbrella making a beautifully fragile pattern of undulating lines and anchored by the stem.  One of my absolute favourites in this challenge.', '2009-12-03 23:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753349, 837101, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. Might have trimmed a little tighter at the top.</td>', 'Lovely colors. Might have trimmed a little tighter at the top.', '2009-12-04 00:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753360, 836128, 111808, '<td valign="top">Each individual feather stands out in this regal portrait of a golden eagle. The defining eye is clear and sharp and so is the beak. Superbly beautiful.</td>', 'Each individual feather stands out in this regal portrait of a golden eagle. The defining eye is clear and sharp and so is the beak. Superbly beautiful.', '2009-12-04 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753363, 836337, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. The softness is beautiful.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. The softness is beautiful.', '2009-12-04 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753374, 836186, 94235, '<td valign="top">After having these little guys for pets my wife just fell in love with this shot. Good take although I might have cropped a little tighter on the right side to even up the shot.</td>', 'After having these little guys for pets my wife just fell in love with this shot. Good take although I might have cropped a little tighter on the right side to even up the shot.', '2009-12-04 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753378, 835562, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. Love the color.</td>', 'Nice close up. Love the color.', '2009-12-04 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753395, 835734, 94235, '<td valign="top">Top shot. Nice seeing some action with the moving water.</td>', 'Top shot. Nice seeing some action with the moving water.', '2009-12-04 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753402, 836759, 111808, '<td valign="top">Expertly lit so that the capillaries and leaf structures stand out in sharp relief inviting a view into the marvellous diversity that is so commonplace in Nature and yet so unseen. The veins resemble a highway with their main thoroughfares and smaller avenues, a well thought out plan to service the leaf with life giving nutrients. Even in its season of slow decay it brings beauty to the world.</td>', 'Expertly lit so that the capillaries and leaf structures stand out in sharp relief inviting a view into the marvellous diversity that is so commonplace in Nature and yet so unseen. The veins resemble a highway with their main thoroughfares and smaller avenues, a well thought out plan to service the leaf with life giving nutrients. Even in its season of slow decay it brings beauty to the world.', '2009-12-04 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753405, 835916, 94235, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if the two white dots were intentional but they tend to distract from the main subject a little. Otherwise a well captured close up.</td>', 'Don''t know if the two white dots were intentional but they tend to distract from the main subject a little. Otherwise a well captured close up.', '2009-12-04 00:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753409, 837036, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good use of DOF.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good use of DOF.', '2009-12-04 00:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
