(5754306, 836126, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and the dof works for me. Maybe it could have been just a teeny bit closer but then you''d have lost some wood grain. Nice one.</td>', 'I like the textures and the dof works for me. Maybe it could have been just a teeny bit closer but then you''d have lost some wood grain. Nice one.', '2009-12-04 12:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754314, 837145, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the selective focus and the composition. And I love the picture. But it''s not really about extreme close-up, IMO. Voting a 5 anyway.</td>', 'I like the selective focus and the composition. And I love the picture. But it''s not really about extreme close-up, IMO. Voting a 5 anyway.', '2009-12-04 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754316, 836004, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely light around the edges. Basic composition. Terrific greens.</td>', 'Lovely light around the edges. Basic composition. Terrific greens.', '2009-12-04 12:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754342, 837106, 100831, '<td valign="top">When I think of rainy shots, I think in color because when things get wet they get kind of shiny and an individual color can be made to stand out nicely. That''s not to say that b/w can''t be good too but the grey in this leaf is a bit bland and the droplets look kind of flat. Maybe some contrast would help. Nice composition though. 5</td>', 'When I think of rainy shots, I think in color because when things get wet they get kind of shiny and an individual color can be made to stand out nicely. That''s not to say that b/w can''t be good too but the grey in this leaf is a bit bland and the droplets look kind of flat. Maybe some contrast would help. Nice composition though. 5', '2009-12-04 12:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754347, 836068, 100831, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors and beautiful bokeh! I like the hints of reflection too.</td>', 'Really nice colors and beautiful bokeh! I like the hints of reflection too.', '2009-12-04 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
