(5754485, 837014, 42256, '<td valign="top">background is distracting with that thread coming out, lighting is not properly done, there is a lot of texture on the green head of the pepper that could have worked really well for the challenge if it was cropped closer and focused on that.</td>', 'background is distracting with that thread coming out, lighting is not properly done, there is a lot of texture on the green head of the pepper that could have worked really well for the challenge if it was cropped closer and focused on that.', '2009-12-04 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
