(5754499, 836704, 42256, '<td valign="top">you should have used tripod for a low light shot like this one.. also the lighting is a bit flat.  Composition could have been stronger, by including the hat and maybe a little more environment.</td>', 'you should have used tripod for a low light shot like this one.. also the lighting is a bit flat.  Composition could have been stronger, by including the hat and maybe a little more environment.', '2009-12-04 14:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754502, 837145, 42256, '<td valign="top">good use of dof to isolate the figures. Better focus and better lighting would have helped the shot.  White blotches and the column on the right going above the head are distracting elements of the shot.</td>', 'good use of dof to isolate the figures. Better focus and better lighting would have helped the shot.  White blotches and the column on the right going above the head are distracting elements of the shot.', '2009-12-04 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754540, 836619, 42256, '<td valign="top">imo subject in not interesting enough.. also the shot could have been better with better lighting and proper focus!</td>', 'imo subject in not interesting enough.. also the shot could have been better with better lighting and proper focus!', '2009-12-04 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754541, 836186, 42256, '<td valign="top">Subject was good, the composition and lighting could have been better.  Background is not working well with the shot!</td>', 'Subject was good, the composition and lighting could have been better.  Background is not working well with the shot!', '2009-12-04 14:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754547, 836149, 42256, '<td valign="top">good subject! lighting a crystal is always challenging, a more colorful background and better lighting would have helped the shot!  Also the shot needs a little more room on the top</td>', 'good subject! lighting a crystal is always challenging, a more colorful background and better lighting would have helped the shot!  Also the shot needs a little more room on the top', '2009-12-04 14:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754548, 836113, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Don''t know if the frog was shot totally in the wild, looking at what it is sitting on it does not look like it.  This could have been a winner if you had a closer crop, more even background and the thing that it is sitting on was not as distracting!</td>', 'Great subject.  Don''t know if the frog was shot totally in the wild, looking at what it is sitting on it does not look like it.  This could have been a winner if you had a closer crop, more even background and the thing that it is sitting on was not as distracting!', '2009-12-04 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754553, 835707, 42256, '<td valign="top">don''t know what this is, maybe a melting ice sculpture or icicle that has been inverted.  Could have been a great shot without the blurry distracting foreground and a more crisp clean background.  Also the lighting on the icicle is not dramatic!</td>', 'don''t know what this is, maybe a melting ice sculpture or icicle that has been inverted.  Could have been a great shot without the blurry distracting foreground and a more crisp clean background.  Also the lighting on the icicle is not dramatic!', '2009-12-04 14:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
