(5755420, 837102, 12674, '<td valign="top">I hope most realize this is an animal and not a flower. Wonderful color and selective focus on your main subject.</td>', 'I hope most realize this is an animal and not a flower. Wonderful color and selective focus on your main subject.', '2009-12-05 07:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
