(5757078, 837057, 10785, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the need for the shallow depth of field on this shot though you did do an awesome job of isolating the eye''s of old Honest Abe. The textures are great, the shadows are not too deep and you managed to get some great highlights with such a short exposure.</td>', 'I don''t see the need for the shallow depth of field on this shot though you did do an awesome job of isolating the eye''s of old Honest Abe. The textures are great, the shadows are not too deep and you managed to get some great highlights with such a short exposure.', '2009-12-06 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757079, 836699, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The B&amp;W selection suits.</td>', 'Good shot. The B&W selection suits.', '2009-12-06 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
