(5759800, 836970, 112556, '<td valign="top">I like the how everything else but the pick is in silhouette. The rainbow pick was a nice choice it adds color to the photo, I also like how you have the sunlight streaming down onto the pick. I rate this a 9 =)</td>', 'I like the how everything else but the pick is in silhouette. The rainbow pick was a nice choice it adds color to the photo, I also like how you have the sunlight streaming down onto the pick. I rate this a 9 =)', '2009-12-08 09:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759805, 836997, 112556, '<td valign="top">This is very cool! I love the red berries and how they are covered in those bubbles. the only this I would suggest would be to crop out the fingers at the top, but thats just in my opinion. I rated this a 9.</td>', 'This is very cool! I love the red berries and how they are covered in those bubbles. the only this I would suggest would be to crop out the fingers at the top, but thats just in my opinion. I rated this a 9.', '2009-12-08 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759877, 837143, 52336, '<td valign="top">Close up like this, these things are really unappealing.</td>', 'Close up like this, these things are really unappealing.', '2009-12-08 10:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759880, 836953, 52336, '<td valign="top">"Macro" yes; accepted as such by DPC viewers, an almost certain no.  What would have made this better for me would have been much better clarity, sharper details, perhaps a square crop, a centre crop, or a thirds-crop, more interesting contrast, a more engaging tonal range.  Quite honestly, this isn''t the best example I''ve seen of a moon macro.</td>', '"Macro" yes; accepted as such by DPC viewers, an almost certain no.  What would have made this better for me would have been much better clarity, sharper details, perhaps a square crop, a centre crop, or a thirds-crop, more interesting contrast, a more engaging tonal range.  Quite honestly, this isn''t the best example I''ve seen of a moon macro.', '2009-12-08 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759884, 836960, 52336, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of the bunch.  At this point in my life, though, I have to say that I really hate adjectives as titles for photographs, especially esoteric ones.</td>', 'Probably the best of the bunch.  At this point in my life, though, I have to say that I really hate adjectives as titles for photographs, especially esoteric ones.', '2009-12-08 10:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
