(5760950, 836963, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> just blow my eyes away sharp and the colours .. words fail me .. !!<br/>this is an extraordinary photograph irene .. you are indeed the master ...<br/>you once said you''d like to have a gtg in the grass near my home .. well i was going to suggest a gtg around your cooker .. well that was when i read that you take a lot of your bubble shots on your ceramic stove top ..<br/>think it would take me many many hours, days, weeks, months .. to do something as amazing as this even if you were coaching me .. <br/>congrats on such a well deserved ribbon .. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, did this on my stove top too. A gtg around my cooker sounds great - just don''t expect me to cook (my husband doesn''t ;-)) He''s thin, but healthy ;-D </i></td></tr></table> <br/>lol LOL .. you''re my kinda girl .. !!.;)</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: Originally posted by roz: just blow my eyes away sharp and the colours .. words fail me .. !!this is an extraordinary photograph irene .. you are indeed the master ...you once said you''d like to have a gtg in the grass near my home .. well i was going to suggest a gtg around your cooker .. well that was when i read that you take a lot of your bubble shots on your ceramic stove top ..think it would take me many many hours, days, weeks, months .. to do something as amazing as this even if you were coaching me .. congrats on such a well deserved ribbon ..  Yes, did this on my stove top too. A gtg around my cooker sounds great - just don''t expect me to cook (my husband doesn''t ;-)) He''s thin, but healthy ;-D  lol LOL .. you''re my kinda girl .. !!.;)', '2009-12-09 03:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
