(5761799, 836963, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Louis:</b></div><hr/><i> Just a comment from "the other side".  It''s sharp, it''s in focus, it''s colourful, but it''s bubbles in water.  Personally, it doesn''t engage me in any way.  It''s pretty, but empty.  Congrats on the ribbon.  The fans may now tear me a new one. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi Louis, I have no problems with comments from the "other side". There are many photos here that I find excellently done but which don''t engage me in any way either... so I know where you''re coming from. This is a big site, there''s room for us all, thank goodness.<br/>Thanks for taking the time to give me your views on the image. In one point you''re wrong though... they''re bubbles but they''re not in water ;-D<br/>All the best,<br/>Irene</td>', 'Originally posted by Louis: Just a comment from "the other side".  It''s sharp, it''s in focus, it''s colourful, but it''s bubbles in water.  Personally, it doesn''t engage me in any way.  It''s pretty, but empty.  Congrats on the ribbon.  The fans may now tear me a new one. ;)  Hi Louis, I have no problems with comments from the "other side". There are many photos here that I find excellently done but which don''t engage me in any way either... so I know where you''re coming from. This is a big site, there''s room for us all, thank goodness.Thanks for taking the time to give me your views on the image. In one point you''re wrong though... they''re bubbles but they''re not in water ;-DAll the best,Irene', '2009-12-09 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 0),
