(5763325, 837140, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first Ribby.And a new PB<br/>Way to go Marion!!!</td>', 'Congrats on your first Ribby.And a new PBWay to go Marion!!!', '2009-12-10 18:31:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5763374, 836337, 112107, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.<br/>Not that the focus point was a choice (using a MF lens with Live View with an extension tube on a 4 months old is basically a game of chance) but I quite like it this way. In this case and IMHO the lashes are more interesting than the eye.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.Not that the focus point was a choice (using a MF lens with Live View with an extension tube on a 4 months old is basically a game of chance) but I quite like it this way. In this case and IMHO the lashes are more interesting than the eye.', '2009-12-10 19:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5763473, 836043, 49865, '<td valign="top">I''m not surprised to see this photo so far down the list given DPC voters'' traditional preferences, but I <b>AM</b> disappointed to see it so. I really enjoyed this photo. As I said in my comment during voting, it really evoked the fluidity and ethereal nature of a sumi-e painting. I''d be curious to know what the subject is.</td>', 'I''m not surprised to see this photo so far down the list given DPC voters'' traditional preferences, but I AM disappointed to see it so. I really enjoyed this photo. As I said in my comment during voting, it really evoked the fluidity and ethereal nature of a sumi-e painting. I''d be curious to know what the subject is.', '2009-12-10 21:57:17.000000', NULL, 0);
