(5764837, 837138, 75034, '<td valign="top">"Oh my freakin'' gosh, this is the most awesome entry EVAH! I am so glad you entered it. My life is now complete." <br/> <br/>Is this still in voting because I would give it like a 27 if I could it is so tubular and gnarly at the same time and totally completes my world.<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', '"Oh my freakin'' gosh, this is the most awesome entry EVAH! I am so glad you entered it. My life is now complete."  Is this still in voting because I would give it like a 27 if I could it is so tubular and gnarly at the same time and totally completes my world. :) MAX!', '2009-12-12 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
