(5765885, 835584, 84438, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing photo Peter.  Huge congrats on the Bluey!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing photo Peter.  Huge congrats on the Bluey!', '2009-12-13 21:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5766725, 836043, 43565, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the challenge!</td>', 'This was my favorite of the challenge!', '2009-12-14 12:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5771561, 836963, 109353, '<td valign="top">Irene, can you share your secret about lightening a bubble without the reflection of the light?<br/>Keep working on the bubbles trails, I want to see what you can do with this. ;)</td>', 'Irene, can you share your secret about lightening a bubble without the reflection of the light?Keep working on the bubbles trails, I want to see what you can do with this. ;)', '2009-12-18 16:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5771748, 836067, 67152, '<td valign="top">A hardy congrats on this!  Well done.  I haven''t been around and just now was poking through the past month or so challenges and happened upon your great image.  SOOOOOO close to a ribbon!</td>', 'A hardy congrats on this!  Well done.  I haven''t been around and just now was poking through the past month or so challenges and happened upon your great image.  SOOOOOO close to a ribbon!', '2009-12-18 19:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5788404, 836963, 46177, '<td valign="top">Hi Irene, don''t know how I missed this, congratulations again!!</td>', 'Hi Irene, don''t know how I missed this, congratulations again!!', '2009-12-31 10:49:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5814923, 835973, 51747, '<td valign="top">These staples look pretty neat. I see you shot at f/32. I wonder if you moved further from your subject and used the 300mm end of the lens if the whole stack of staples might be in focus?</td>', 'These staples look pretty neat. I see you shot at f/32. I wonder if you moved further from your subject and used the 300mm end of the lens if the whole stack of staples might be in focus?', '2010-01-16 19:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816196, 837083, 112798, '<td valign="top">This picture is awesome.  Despite the subject matter being something most people aren''t happy to see, I think that it''s incredible to be able to photograph something like this.  I mean, really, it''s just an arbitrary object with a whole lot of symbolic meaning.  It can be made into anything, and you made it dramatic, interesting, and eye-catching.  Stepping away from that, I only wish that more of the skull were visible.  Had I voted, I would have given it a 7-8.</td>', 'This picture is awesome.  Despite the subject matter being something most people aren''t happy to see, I think that it''s incredible to be able to photograph something like this.  I mean, really, it''s just an arbitrary object with a whole lot of symbolic meaning.  It can be made into anything, and you made it dramatic, interesting, and eye-catching.  Stepping away from that, I only wish that more of the skull were visible.  Had I voted, I would have given it a 7-8.', '2010-01-17 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5821495, 836067, 73564, '<td valign="top">Jan really likes this one..I told her how its your highest rated photo...<br/> <br/>She got a card from Barb and was reading to me...and she said look, the lighthouse..and I was like "wait..Thats Janine''s"....she looks on the back and "yeah..there''s her name"..I was laughing because I had recognized it..."I''m good!" lol</td>', 'Jan really likes this one..I told her how its your highest rated photo... She got a card from Barb and was reading to me...and she said look, the lighthouse..and I was like "wait..Thats Janine''s"....she looks on the back and "yeah..there''s her name"..I was laughing because I had recognized it..."I''m good!" lol', '2010-01-21 16:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5937622, 836987, 76712, '<td valign="top">the human eye see in 264 megapixles...apparently so yeah, the ultimate lens</td>', 'the human eye see in 264 megapixles...apparently so yeah, the ultimate lens', '2010-04-08 16:22:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6108756, 836067, 40718, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just love these things?  Did you hand-hold this?  If you had a tripod with you, it would have probably helped to increase the f-stop so as to get more of the subject in focus.  Lots of times a shallow DOF can be good in macro, but I don''t think it helps you here.  If you know you are shooting for DPC and you don''t have a tripod a trick is to pull back and then crop later.  The further you pull back, the wider the DOF becomes while keeping the same shutter speed.</td>', 'Don''t you just love these things?  Did you hand-hold this?  If you had a tripod with you, it would have probably helped to increase the f-stop so as to get more of the subject in focus.  Lots of times a shallow DOF can be good in macro, but I don''t think it helps you here.  If you know you are shooting for DPC and you don''t have a tripod a trick is to pull back and then crop later.  The further you pull back, the wider the DOF becomes while keeping the same shutter speed.', '2010-07-29 16:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6115631, 836164, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2010-08-03 15:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245159, 836557, 109363, '<td valign="top">prints and greeting cards of this image can be obtained here<br/> <br/><a href="//fineartamerica.com/featured/inner-glow-mark-fuller.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Inner-Glow</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'prints and greeting cards of this image can be obtained here Inner-Glow  Thanks!', '2010-12-05 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6264640, 836009, 125385, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing.  I love this shot with all the details, FANTASTIC!</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing.  I love this shot with all the details, FANTASTIC!', '2010-12-30 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 0);
